VisionTalk: Theory & Evaluation Report
BY AYUSH RAJPUT

1. Architecture Overview
The system merges a pretrained VGG16 CNN encoder with an LSTM decoder to generate natural-language captions for images.

2. Training & Inference
Trained using Teacher Forcing on the Flickr8k dataset with categorical cross-entropy loss. Inference uses a greedy search strategy until the 'endseq' token is predicted.

3. Evaluation
Performance is measured using BLEU-1 and BLEU-4 evaluation metrics against human references.
